Use `!category <name>` to list functions in a specific category.}
Zcolor{#ffffff}
  ZaddField{variables;Persistent variable storage;false}
  ZaddField{voice;Voice channel operations and queries;false}
ZaddButton{no;cat3;Previous Page;secondary}
